  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Projectile A is fired at angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> from a horizontal surface, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0 &lt; \\theta &lt;90^{\\circ}\"></span> and air resistance is negligible. The maximum height reached by the projectile is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span> and the speed of the projectile at this maximum height is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Projectile B is fired from a horizontal surface at the same angle and at the same initial velocity as Projectile A. For Projectile B, air resistance is not negligible.</p>\n<p>What is correct about the maximum height reached by Projectile B and its speed at this maximum height?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Maximum height reached by Projectile B</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Speed of Projectile B at maximum height</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"H\"></span></td>\n<td>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
